-------------+----------------------------------------------------
           1 |         74      0.0604         2.960
           2 |         81      0.0661         3.240
           3 |         77      0.0629         3.080
------------------------------------------------------------------

------------------------------------------------------------------
      Period |    Kept   Created  Dissolved   Jaccard   Hamming
-------------+----------------------------------------------------
        1->2 |      43        38         31     0.384        69
        2->3 |      47        30         34     0.423        64
